# Real gap found July 25 during the Impeccable/emilkowalski-skills
# Aintergration pass: this repo is public, and neither of these was
# covered - node_modules would get committed if any npx-based dev tool
# (Impeccable's CLI, etc.) is ever run locally, and settings.local.json
# is meant to be machine-local per Claude Code's own convention.
node_modules/
.claude/settings.local.json
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
.impeccable/*.png
.impeccable/live/
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cost.json
# graphify's own dated curated-graph backups (created by `graphify label`/
# `graphify update` runs) - no retention practice established for these,
# would silently bloat the repo with a new folder every session otherwise.
graphify-out/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
